// Sublime Text's default keymap (a representative subset — see
// docs/receipts/phase-05-keymaps-sublime-vscode-jetbrains-como.md for
// sourcing: Sublime doesn't publish a plain-text reference table the way
// VS Code and JetBrains do, so this comes from well-established prior
// knowledge of these long-stable, widely-documented defaults rather than a
// fetched citation). "key" is the Windows/Linux default, "mac" overrides
// it where macOS differs.
[
  // VS Code's command palette shortcut was borrowed from this one.
  { "command": "command_palette", "key": "ctrl+shift+p", "mac": "cmd+shift+p" },
  { "command": "quick_open", "key": "ctrl+p", "mac": "cmd+p" },
  { "command": "file.new", "key": "ctrl+n", "mac": "cmd+n" },
  { "command": "quick_open", "key": "cmd+t", "mac": "cmd+t" },
  { "command": "find", "key": "ctrl+f", "mac": "cmd+f" },
  { "command": "replace", "key": "ctrl+h", "mac": "cmd+alt+f" },
  { "command": "find_next", "key": "f3", "mac": "cmd+g" },
  { "command": "find_prev", "key": "shift+f3", "mac": "cmd+shift+g" },
  { "command": "find_all", "key": "alt+enter", "mac": "alt+enter" },
  { "command": "find_in_files", "key": "ctrl+shift+f", "mac": "cmd+shift+f" },
  { "command": "next_result", "key": "f4", "mac": "f4" },
  { "command": "prev_result", "key": "shift+f4", "mac": "shift+f4" },
  // Kept as Ctrl on mac too, not remapped to Cmd.
  { "command": "goto_line", "key": "ctrl+g", "mac": "ctrl+g" },
  { "command": "goto_symbol", "key": "ctrl+r", "mac": "cmd+r" },
  { "command": "goto_symbol_in_project", "key": "ctrl+shift+r", "mac": "cmd+shift+r" },
  { "command": "duplicate_line", "key": "ctrl+shift+d", "mac": "cmd+shift+d" },
  { "command": "insert_line_after", "key": "ctrl+enter", "mac": "cmd+enter" },
  { "command": "insert_line_before", "key": "ctrl+shift+enter", "mac": "cmd+shift+enter" },
  { "command": "use_selection_for_find", "key": "ctrl+e", "mac": "cmd+e" },
  { "command": "delete_line", "key": "ctrl+shift+k", "mac": "cmd+shift+k" },
  { "command": "swap_line_up", "key": "ctrl+shift+up", "mac": "ctrl+cmd+up" },
  { "command": "swap_line_down", "key": "ctrl+shift+down", "mac": "ctrl+cmd+down" },
  { "command": "join_lines", "key": "ctrl+j", "mac": "cmd+j" },
  { "command": "toggle_comment", "key": "ctrl+/", "mac": "cmd+/" },
  { "command": "toggle_block_comment", "key": "ctrl+shift+/", "mac": "cmd+alt+/" },
  { "command": "indent", "key": "ctrl+]", "mac": "cmd+]" },
  { "command": "dedent", "key": "ctrl+[", "mac": "cmd+[" },
  { "command": "markdown_preview", "key": "ctrl+shift+v", "mac": "cmd+shift+v" },
  { "command": "select_next_occurrence", "key": "ctrl+d", "mac": "cmd+d" },
  { "command": "skip_next_occurrence", "key": "ctrl+k ctrl+d", "mac": "cmd+k cmd+d" },
  { "command": "select_all_occurrences", "key": "alt+f3", "mac": "ctrl+cmd+g" },
  { "command": "split_selection_into_lines", "key": "ctrl+shift+l", "mac": "cmd+shift+l" },
  { "command": "add_cursor_above", "key": "ctrl+alt+up", "mac": "ctrl+shift+up" },
  { "command": "add_cursor_below", "key": "ctrl+alt+down", "mac": "ctrl+shift+down" },
  { "command": "expand_to_line", "key": "ctrl+l", "mac": "cmd+l" },
  { "command": "expand_to_scope", "key": "ctrl+shift+space", "mac": "cmd+shift+space" },
  { "command": "expand_to_tag", "key": "ctrl+shift+a", "mac": "cmd+shift+a" },
  { "command": "fold", "key": "ctrl+shift+[", "mac": "cmd+alt+[" },
  { "command": "unfold", "key": "ctrl+shift+]", "mac": "cmd+alt+]" },
  { "command": "fold_all", "key": "ctrl+k ctrl+1", "mac": "cmd+k cmd+1" },
  { "command": "fold_all", "key": "ctrl+k 1", "mac": "cmd+k 1" },
  { "command": "unfold_all", "key": "ctrl+k ctrl+j", "mac": "cmd+k cmd+j" },
  { "command": "unfold_all", "key": "ctrl+k j", "mac": "cmd+k j" },
  { "command": "fold_level_2", "key": "ctrl+k ctrl+2", "mac": "cmd+k cmd+2" },
  { "command": "fold_level_2", "key": "ctrl+k 2", "mac": "cmd+k 2" },
  { "command": "fold_level_3", "key": "ctrl+k ctrl+3", "mac": "cmd+k cmd+3" },
  { "command": "fold_level_3", "key": "ctrl+k 3", "mac": "cmd+k 3" },
  { "command": "fold_level_4", "key": "ctrl+k ctrl+4", "mac": "cmd+k cmd+4" },
  { "command": "fold_level_4", "key": "ctrl+k 4", "mac": "cmd+k 4" },
  { "command": "fold_level_5", "key": "ctrl+k ctrl+5", "mac": "cmd+k cmd+5" },
  { "command": "fold_level_5", "key": "ctrl+k 5", "mac": "cmd+k 5" },
  { "command": "undo", "key": "ctrl+z", "mac": "cmd+z" },
  { "command": "redo", "key": "ctrl+shift+z", "mac": "cmd+shift+z" },
  { "command": "redo", "key": "ctrl+y", "mac": "cmd+y" },
  { "command": "save", "key": "ctrl+s", "mac": "cmd+s" },
  { "command": "save_all", "key": "ctrl+alt+s", "mac": "cmd+alt+s" },
  { "command": "reopen_closed_tab", "key": "ctrl+shift+t", "mac": "cmd+shift+t" },
  { "command": "prev_tab", "key": "ctrl+pageup", "mac": "cmd+shift+[" },
  { "command": "next_tab", "key": "ctrl+pagedown", "mac": "cmd+shift+]" },
  { "command": "zoom_in", "key": "ctrl+=", "mac": "cmd+=" },
  { "command": "zoom_in", "key": "ctrl+shift+=", "mac": "cmd+shift+=" },
  { "command": "zoom_out", "key": "ctrl+-", "mac": "cmd+-" },
  { "command": "zoom_reset", "key": "ctrl+0", "mac": "cmd+0" },
  { "command": "open_settings", "key": "ctrl+,", "mac": "cmd+," },
  { "command": "jump_to_matching_bracket", "key": "ctrl+m", "mac": "ctrl+m" },
  { "command": "toggle_bookmark", "key": "ctrl+f2", "mac": "cmd+f2" },
  { "command": "next_bookmark", "key": "f2", "mac": "f2" },
  { "command": "prev_bookmark", "key": "shift+f2", "mac": "shift+f2" },
  { "command": "clear_bookmarks", "key": "ctrl+shift+f2", "mac": "cmd+shift+f2" },
  { "command": "select_all_bookmarks", "key": "alt+f2", "mac": "alt+f2" },
  { "command": "set_layout_single", "key": "alt+shift+1", "mac": "cmd+alt+1" },
  { "command": "set_layout_columns_2", "key": "alt+shift+2", "mac": "cmd+alt+2" },
  { "command": "set_layout_columns_3", "key": "alt+shift+3", "mac": "cmd+alt+3" },
  { "command": "set_layout_columns_4", "key": "alt+shift+4", "mac": "cmd+alt+4" },
  { "command": "set_layout_rows_2", "key": "alt+shift+8", "mac": "cmd+alt+shift+2" },
  { "command": "set_layout_rows_3", "key": "alt+shift+9", "mac": "cmd+alt+shift+3" },
  { "command": "set_layout_grid_2x2", "key": "alt+shift+5", "mac": "cmd+alt+5" },
  { "command": "focus_group_1", "key": "ctrl+1", "mac": "ctrl+1" },
  { "command": "focus_group_2", "key": "ctrl+2", "mac": "ctrl+2" },
  { "command": "focus_group_3", "key": "ctrl+3", "mac": "ctrl+3" },
  { "command": "focus_group_4", "key": "ctrl+4", "mac": "ctrl+4" },
  { "command": "move_to_group_1", "key": "ctrl+shift+1", "mac": "ctrl+shift+1" },
  { "command": "move_to_group_2", "key": "ctrl+shift+2", "mac": "ctrl+shift+2" },
  { "command": "move_to_group_3", "key": "ctrl+shift+3", "mac": "ctrl+shift+3" },
  { "command": "move_to_group_4", "key": "ctrl+shift+4", "mac": "ctrl+shift+4" },
  { "command": "build", "key": "ctrl+b", "mac": "cmd+b" },
  { "command": "build_with", "key": "ctrl+shift+b", "mac": "cmd+shift+b" },
  { "command": "cancel_build", "key": "ctrl+break", "mac": "cmd+alt+c" },
  { "command": "toggle_sidebar", "key": "ctrl+k ctrl+b", "mac": "cmd+k cmd+b" },
  { "command": "quick_switch_project", "key": "ctrl+alt+p", "mac": "cmd+ctrl+p" },
  { "command": "toggle_distraction_free", "key": "shift+f11", "mac": "cmd+ctrl+shift+f" },
  { "command": "insert_snippet", "key": "ctrl+alt+j", "mac": "cmd+alt+j" },
  { "command": "toggle_record_macro", "key": "ctrl+q", "mac": "ctrl+q" },
  { "command": "playback_macro", "key": "ctrl+shift+q", "mac": "cmd+shift+q" },
  { "command": "save_macro", "key": "ctrl+alt+shift+s", "mac": "cmd+alt+shift+s" },
]
